    "_leaflet": "ALDI SÜD weekly leaflet, valid Mo. 13.7. to Sa. 18.7. (cover). Mostly non-food Aktionsartikel: only pages 11 to 18 carry food, so the 10 picks cannot all be food and are not fully non-consecutive (13/14/15 and 17/18 adjacent). Page 12 was skipped: 1 printed price, all other items PREIS FOLGT. ALDI shows no struck prices in this leaflet. Many items are PREIS FOLGT (price not printed): p null, c \"PREIS FOLGT\". Price-to-product links are by layout (price box below or right of the text block); text layer has no explicit link. \"*\" after prices is the Aktionsartikel footnote, not a condition. Header date (ab Do./ab Fr.) copied into c where it differs from the leaflet start.",
    "3": "Plant callouts (Grasnelke, Edelrosen, Rosen-Stamm, Coreopsis, Kokardenblume) are printed z. B. variants of the GARDENLINE offer with their own price; listed as separate offers. Yoga/Pilates and Massage items: several named sub-items (Pilates-Kissen, Pilates-Ring, Yoga-Blöcke, Yoga-Gurte, Massage-Bälle, etc.) appear as image callouts without own prices; not listed.",
    "5": "Price links ambiguous for IQ Denkspiele (8.99 sits above-right of its text), Geschicklichkeitsspiele aus Holz (3.99) and Kaleidoskop-Malbuch-Set (4.99): assigned by nearest price box above-right; verify on image.",
    "9": "Beistelltisch 12.99 and Kokos-Fußmatte 3.99 assigned by layout; could be swapped, verify on image.",
    "11": "Nagellack oder Make-up 2.49: price box is above-right of its text, assignment by layout. Unnamed callout \"5.99* 4 x 50 g = 200-g-Packung, kg-Preis 29.95\" is a variant of the Selbst Aktiv/Kraft Aktiv offer whose name is only in the image: not listed.",
    "13": "Grillbauch: text \"versch. Gewichte 1 kg\" with 6.99; read as price per 1 kg. Entrecôte 4.99 is for the z. B. 249 g example weight.",
    "14": "Unnamed SOS variant callouts with own prices (name only in image): \"6.99* 34-tlg.\", \"3.49* 50-ml-Sprühflasche, l-Preis 69.80\", \"3.49* 125-ml-Tube, l-Preis 27.92\": not listed. Coffee categorized drinks.",
